From: Peyton Howe <peyton@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: rockchip: IMX708 camera overlays

Overlays for ROCK 5B+ CAM0/CAM1 and Orange Pi 5/5B CAM1/CAM2/CAM3.

CAM1 uses Inno CSI D-PHY (csi2). CAM2/CAM3 use Samsung DCPHY CSI RX
(csi0/csi1) enabled in the DCPHY CSI host patch.

